window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-007-bfdb6dd63aad1ea1.json"]={sha256:"bfdb6dd63aad1ea16ebf88dc02784372ff7da512a513da5ec3b0e91d95c12ad5",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-a3054099b553bbb6","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204","title":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","titleEn":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","publisher":"Rasmussen et al., PRX Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-007","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-007","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-008","referenceUrls":["https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204"],"title":"Google 超導脈衝：DRAG 殘差代理與校準","titleEn":"Google superconducting pulses: DRAG residual proxy and calibration","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付Rabi曲線、角度誤差與兩種原因的辨識表。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver a Rabi curve, angle error and a two-cause discrimination table. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Google 超導脈衝：DRAG 殘差代理與校準』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付殘差拋物線、I/Q時序圖與相位檢查清單。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Google superconducting pulses: DRAG residual proxy and calibration', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver a residual parabola, I/Q timing diagram and phase checks.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：共振兩能階模型P1=sin²(Ωt/2)；以f_R=Ω/(2π)表示時P1=sin²(π f_R t)。 使用合成f_R=10 MHz，t=50 ns；忽略失諧、洩漏及包絡整形。 以手算或試算表計算名義式sin(pi*10e6*50e-9)**2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以θ=2πf_Rt先算角度，再用(1−cosθ)/2交叉檢查；ns與MHz乘積需含10⁻³。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：本題用原創代理L=(εΩ/Δ)²，ε是校正後導數通道殘差比例；它只適合比較殘差，不是完整DRAG推導。 使用教學Ω/2π=20 MHz、Δ/2π=200 MHz、ε=0.2。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(0.2*20/200)**2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：掃描ε=−0.2、0、0.2，確認平方模型對稱；若合成資料不對稱，增加相位或失諧項而不硬套拋物線。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For a resonant two-level model P1=sin²(Ωt/2)=sin²(π f_R t), where f_R=Ω/(2π). Use Synthetic f_R=10 MHz and t=50 ns; detuning, leakage and shaping are omitted. Evaluate nominal expression sin(pi*10e6*50e-9)**2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Calculate θ=2πf_Rt, then cross-check using(1−cosθ)/2; ns times MHz includes10⁻³.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Use original proxy L=(εΩ/Δ)² with residual quadrature factor ε; it compares residuals, not a complete DRAG derivation. Use Teaching Ω/2π=20 MHz, Δ/2π=200 MHz and ε=0.2. Evaluate nominal expression (0.2*20/200)**2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Sweep ε=−0.2,0,0.2 to test symmetry; asymmetric data require phase or detuning terms, not a forced parabola.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-017","referenceUrls":["https://quantumai.google/cirq/tutorials/google/identifying_hardware_changes"],"title":"Google 讀出校正：混淆矩陣反算","titleEn":"Google readout correction: confusion-matrix inversion","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付Rabi曲線、角度誤差與兩種原因的辨識表。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver a Rabi curve, angle error and a two-cause discrimination table. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Google 讀出校正：混淆矩陣反算』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付前向／逆向表、條件性警示與校準批次識別。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Google readout correction: confusion-matrix inversion', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver forward/inverse tables, conditioning warnings and calibration-batch identifiers.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：共振兩能階模型P1=sin²(Ωt/2)；以f_R=Ω/(2π)表示時P1=sin²(π f_R t)。 使用合成f_R=10 MHz，t=50 ns；忽略失諧、洩漏及包絡整形。 以手算或試算表計算名義式sin(pi*10e6*50e-9)**2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以θ=2πf_Rt先算角度，再用(1−cosθ)/2交叉檢查；ns與MHz乘積需含10⁻³。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：設e0=P(報1給真0)、e1=P(報0給真1)，q=e0+(1−e0−e1)p；反算p=(q−e0)/(1−e0−e1)。 使用合成觀察q=0.35、e0=0.05、e1=0.10；矩陣列和須為1。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(0.35-0.05)/(1-0.05-0.10)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：將p代回前向式應還原0.35；當e0+e1趨近1時，記錄分母與噪聲放大。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: For a resonant two-level model P1=sin²(Ωt/2)=sin²(π f_R t), where f_R=Ω/(2π). Use Synthetic f_R=10 MHz and t=50 ns; detuning, leakage and shaping are omitted. Evaluate nominal expression sin(pi*10e6*50e-9)**2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Calculate θ=2πf_Rt, then cross-check using(1−cosθ)/2; ns times MHz includes10⁻³.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Let e0=P(report1|true0) and e1=P(report0|true1); q=e0+(1−e0−e1)p, hence p=(q−e0)/(1−e0−e1). Use Synthetic observed q=0.35, e0=0.05 and e1=0.10; matrix columns must sum to1. Evaluate nominal expression (0.35-0.05)/(1-0.05-0.10) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Forward-substitute p to recover0.35; as e0+e1 approaches1, record denominator and noise amplification.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-a3054099b553bbb6","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204","title":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","titleEn":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","publisher":"Rasmussen et al., PRX Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-2edf39976eb0ca17","url":"https://quantumai.google/cirq/tutorials/google/identifying_hardware_changes","title":"Identifying Hardware Changes","titleEn":"Identifying Hardware Changes","publisher":"Google Quantum AI","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
